00:09:50.744 --> 00:09:54.775
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:55.375 --> 00:10:03.535
<v Slow>日産自動車の最終的な利益は、何億円の黒字でしたか。

00:10:04.336 --> 00:10:06.615
<v Host>Three point seven billion yen.

00:10:07.216 --> 00:10:12.327
<v Slow>黒字になったのは、何年ぶりですか。

00:10:13.128 --> 00:10:16.488
<v Host>Two years — the first profit in two years.

00:10:17.087 --> 00:10:26.423
<v Slow>日産は、今年度の販売台数の見通しを、何万台引き下げましたか。

00:10:27.224 --> 00:10:33.967
<v Host>One hundred fifty thousand vehicles, because of weaker demand in China and turmoil in the Middle East.

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:44.216
<v Host>That's all for today. Nissan climbed out of the red for the first time in two years, but its recovery is far from finished. See you tomorrow.

00:10:44.816 --> 00:10:47.216
<v News>また明日。
